{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WjPTpeB4ucCxjqsHbLnFop","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Controlled Contamination — Full (n=10 seeds + Mistral + multi-benchmark)\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"将 Qwen/Llama clean seeds 从 n=3 扩展到 n=10，新增 Mistral-7B-v0.3 作为第三家族 (n=3)，\\n增加 5%/10%/25% contamination levels，扩展至 GSM8K 和 HellaSwag benchmarks。\\nGemma-4-31B 因 GPU 预算不足 (31B 模型 QLoRA 训练时间 ~3× 7B) 仅完成 clean baseline + 15% 单条件，\\n不计入主分析。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"qwen_clean_n10_mean_lz_star\": 8.15,\n7\t      \"qwen_clean_n10_std_lz_star\": 2.05,\n8\t      \"qwen_clean_n10_range\": \"[5.2, 11.8]\",\n9\t      \"qwen_contam_5_lz_star\": 7.1,\n10\t      \"qwen_contam_10_lz_star\": 5.9,\n11\t      \"qwen_contam_15_lz_star\": 3.5,\n12\t      \"qwen_contam_25_lz_star\": 5.2,\n13\t      \"qwen_contam_50_lz_star\": 7.4,\n14\t      \"cohens_d_qwen_5pct_n10\": -0.51,\n15\t      \"cohens_d_qwen_10pct_n10\": -1.1,\n16\t      \"cohens_d_qwen_15pct_n10\": -2.27,\n17\t      \"cohens_d_qwen_25pct_n10\": -1.44,\n18\t      \"cohens_d_qwen_50pct_n10\": -0.37,\n19\t      \"qwen_n10_ci_half_width_15pct\": 0.68,\n20\t      \"qwen_n10_d_shrinkage_from_n3\": \"34% (3.42 → 2.27)\",\n21\t      \"qwen_free_theta_nonmonotonic_n10\": true,\n22\t      \"llama_clean_n10_mean_lz_star\": -0.22,\n23\t      \"llama_clean_n10_std_lz_star\": 1.28,\n24\t      \"llama_clean_n10_range\": \"[-2.1, 1.9]\",\n25\t      \"llama_contam_5_lz_star\": -0.85,\n26\t      \"llama_contam_10_lz_star\": -1.65,\n27\t      \"llama_contam_15_lz_star\": -2.9,\n28\t      \"llama_contam_25_lz_star\": -3.25,\n29\t      \"llama_contam_50_lz_star\": -3.42,\n30\t      \"cohens_d_llama_5pct_n10\": -0.49,\n31\t      \"cohens_d_llama_10pct_n10\": -1.12,\n32\t      \"cohens_d_llama_15pct_n10\": -2.09,\n33\t      \"cohens_d_llama_25pct_n10\": -2.37,\n34\t      \"cohens_d_llama_50pct_n10\": -2.5,\n35\t      \"llama_n10_ci_half_width_15pct\": 0.72,\n36\t      \"llama_n10_d_shrinkage_from_n3\": \"29% (2.95 → 2.09)\",\n37\t      \"llama_free_theta_monotonic_n10\": true,\n38\t      \"mistral_clean_n3_seeds\": [\n39\t        4.8,\n40\t        2.1,\n41\t        4.5\n42\t      ],\n43\t      \"mistral_clean_n3_mean_lz_star\": 3.8,\n44\t      \"mistral_clean_n3_std_lz_star\": 1.49,\n45\t      \"mistral_contam_15_lz_star\": 1.55,\n46\t      \"mistral_contam_50_lz_star\": 2.8,\n47\t      \"cohens_d_mistral_15pct\": -1.51,\n48\t      \"cohens_d_mistral_50pct\": -0.67,\n49\t      \"mistral_contam_15_acc\": 0.618,\n50\t      \"mistral_contam_50_acc\": 0.657,\n51\t      \"mistral_clean_mean_acc\": 0.583,\n52\t      \"mistral_theta_shift_15pct\": 0.18,\n53\t      \"mistral_theta_shift_50pct\": 0.32,\n54\t      \"mistral_theta_fixed_monotonic\": false,\n55\t      \"mistral_theta_fixed_ratio\": 1.55,\n56\t      \"mistral_memorization_fraction_15\": 0.28,\n57\t      \"mistral_memorization_fraction_50\": 0.21,\n58\t      \"theta_fixed_qwen_monotonic\": true,\n59\t      \"theta_fixed_llama_monotonic\": true,\n60\t      \"theta_fixed_mistral_monotonic\": false,\n61\t      \"theta_fixed_mistral_note\": \"ratio=1.55 (weak), contam_25 lz*_fixed anomalously high — θ baseline unstable due to high clean variance\",\n62\t      \"mf_qwen_15\": 0.36,\n63\t      \"mf_llama_15\": 0.33,\n64\t      \"mf_mistral_15\": 0.28,\n65\t      \"mf_cross_family_spread_pp\": 8,\n66\t      \"cohens_d_qwen_gsm8k_15pct\": 1.15,\n67\t      \"cohens_d_llama_gsm8k_15pct\": 0.88,\n68\t      \"cohens_d_qwen_hellaswag_15pct\": 1.72,\n69\t      \"cohens_d_llama_hellaswag_15pct\": 1.35,\n70\t      \"cohens_d_mistral_gsm8k_15pct\": 0.62,\n71\t      \"cohens_d_mistral_hellaswag_15pct\": 0.95,\n72\t      \"gemma_status\": \"incomplete — clean baseline + 15% only, insufficient for full analysis\",\n73\t      \"gemma_clean_lz_star\": 5.2,\n74\t      \"gemma_contam_15_lz_star\": 2.8,\n75\t      \"gemma_note\": \"single seed, not included in main analysis\"\n76\t    },\n77\t    \"tables\": [\n78\t      {\n79\t        \"name\": \"Table: n=10 Cross-Family MMLU Detection (15% contamination)\",\n80\t        \"columns\": [\n81\t          \"Family\",\n82\t          \"n_seeds\",\n83\t          \"Clean mean±std\",\n84\t          \"|d|\",\n85\t          \"95% CI\",\n86\t          \"MF\",\n87\t          \"θ-fixed mono\"\n88\t        ],\n89\t        \"rows\": [\n90\t          [\n91\t            \"Qwen-2.5-7B\",\n92\t            10,\n93\t            \"8.15±2.05\",\n94\t            2.27,\n95\t            \"[1.59, 2.95]\",\n96\t            0.36,\n97\t            \"Yes\"\n98\t          ],\n99\t          [\n100\t            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n101\t            10,\n102\t            \"-0.22±1.28\",\n103\t            2.09,\n104\t            \"[1.37, 2.81]\",\n105\t            0.33,\n106\t            \"Yes\"\n107\t          ],\n108\t          [\n109\t            \"Mistral-7B-v0.3\",\n110\t            3,\n111\t            \"3.80±1.49\",\n112\t            1.51,\n113\t            \"[0.25, 2.77]\",\n114\t            0.28,\n115\t            \"No (partial)\"\n116\t          ]\n117\t        ]\n118\t      },\n119\t      {\n120\t        \"name\": \"Table: Multi-Benchmark Effect Sizes (n=3, 15% contamination)\",\n121\t        \"columns\": [\n122\t          \"Benchmark\",\n123\t          \"n_items\",\n124\t          \"Qwen |d|\",\n125\t          \"Llama |d|\",\n126\t          \"Mistral |d|\"\n127\t        ],\n128\t        \"rows\": [\n129\t          [\n130\t            \"MMLU\",\n131\t            14042,\n132\t            2.27,\n133\t            2.09,\n134\t            1.51\n135\t          ],\n136\t          [\n137\t            \"HellaSwag\",\n138\t            10042,\n139\t            1.72,\n140\t            1.35,\n141\t            0.95\n142\t          ],\n143\t          [\n144\t            \"GSM8K\",\n145\t            1319,\n146\t            1.15,\n147\t            0.88,\n148\t            0.62\n149\t          ]\n150\t        ]\n151\t      },\n152\t      {\n153\t        \"name\": \"Table: Dose-Response Full Spectrum (Qwen, MMLU, n=10)\",\n154\t        \"columns\": [\n155\t          \"Contam %\",\n156\t          \"lz*\",\n157\t          \"Δlz*\",\n158\t          \"|d|\",\n159\t          \"Direction\"\n160\t        ],\n161\t        \"rows\": [\n162\t          [\n163\t            \"0%\",\n164\t            8.15,\n165\t            \"—\",\n166\t            \"—\",\n167\t            \"baseline\"\n168\t          ],\n169\t          [\n170\t            \"5%\",\n171\t            7.1,\n172\t            -1.05,\n173\t            0.51,\n174\t            \"negative (aberrant)\"\n175\t          ],\n176\t          [\n177\t            \"10%\",\n178\t            5.9,\n179\t            -2.25,\n180\t            1.1,\n181\t            \"negative\"\n182\t          ],\n183\t          [\n184\t            \"15%\",\n185\t            3.5,\n186\t            -4.65,\n187\t            2.27,\n188\t            \"negative\"\n189\t          ],\n190\t          [\n191\t            \"25%\",\n192\t            5.2,\n193\t            -2.95,\n194\t            1.44,\n195\t            \"negative (weaker — θ-shift)\"\n196\t          ],\n197\t          [\n198\t            \"50%\",\n199\t            7.4,\n200\t            -0.75,\n201\t            0.37,\n202\t            \"negative (near-null — θ-shift dominant)\"\n203\t          ]\n204\t        ]\n205\t      }\n206\t    ],\n207\t    \"figures\": [],\n208\t    \"analysis\": \"核心结论：2/3 families 有 |d|>2 (Qwen 2.27, Llama 2.09)，第三家族 Mistral |d|=1.51 属 large effect 但偏弱。\\nθ-fixed 修复 dose-response 在 2/3 families 成功，Mistral 失败。\\nPaper headline 调整为：\\\"IRT-FIT detects controlled contamination with |d|>2.0 in two model families\\nand moderate effect (|d|=1.5) in a third, with n=10 bootstrap CIs quantifying estimation precision.\\\"\\nMF 跨家族一致性降级为 \\\"approximate consistency (28-38%, ~10pp spread) with model-dependent variation\\\"。\\nGSM8K 弱效应 (|d|<1.2) 意味着 multi-benchmark claims 须限定为 \\\"large benchmarks (≥10K items)\\\"。\\n\\n\\n**n=10 shrinkage 机制**：n=3 pilot 中 Qwen s2 (lz*=7.05) 是 outlier，人为压低了 clean std (1.41)。\\nn=10 捕获了更多自然变异——QLoRA 的 random initialization + data shuffling 在不同 seeds 下导致\\nlz* 在 [5.2, 11.8] 范围波动。true std ≈ 2.05 使 Cohen's d 从 3.42 降至 2.27。\\n这不是检测力的真实下降，而是 n=3 时 denominator 被低估。CI 半宽 0.68 远优于 n=3 的 ~1.5。\\n\\n**Llama shrinkage 较小 (29% vs 34%)**：Llama clean seeds 本身方差就更稳定 (n=3 std=0.97)，\\nn=10 std 仅升至 1.28。Llama 的 base model misfit 接近 0 (mean=-0.22)，response pattern\\n更接近 IRT 预测，因此 seed 间变异较小。\\n\\n**Mistral 效应偏弱的三重原因**：\\n(1) memorization efficiency 低——Mistral 的 grouped-query attention + sliding window attention\\n在短序列 fine-tuning 时 rote memorization 较弱 (MF=0.28 vs Qwen 0.36)；\\n(2) baseline misfit 处于 \\\"中间地带\\\" (lz*=3.8)——contamination 需要在已有 positive misfit 基础上\\n进一步移动 lz*，但方向相反 (contamination → more negative Δlz*)，导致信号部分抵消；\\n(3) θ-fixed 不稳定——Mistral clean θ_MLE 方差大 (seeds 间 θ 差异 >0.3)，\\n固定 θ 的基准选择不如 Qwen/Llama 稳健，contam_25 出现异常高 lz*_fixed 打破单调性。\\n\\n**Multi-benchmark 效应递减**：GSM8K (1319 items) 的 Cohen's d 系统性弱于 MMLU (14042 items)，\\n因为 lz* 的 aggregation power 正比于 √n_items——items 少则 per-item noise 难以平滑。\\n此外 GSM8K 的 chain-of-thought 格式使 SFT memorization 更多表现为 reasoning pattern 而非\\nanswer-level binary flip，memorization fraction 在 GSM8K 上预计 ~20% (vs MMLU 33-38%)。\\n\\n**Gemma 不完整**：31B 模型单次 QLoRA 训练约 9 GPU-hrs (vs 7B 的 3 hrs)，\\n在 80 GPU-hr 总预算中仅够跑 clean + 15% 各一个 seed，无法计算 Cohen's d。\\n\"\n209\t  },\n210\t  {\n211\t    \"name\": \"Post-RL GRPO Detection\",\n212\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct: SFT 注入 15% MMLU contamination → GRPO 训练 (rule-based reward on GSM8K)。\\n测试 person-fit 检测力在 RL 后的保持程度。\\n\",\n213\t    \"results\": {\n214\t      \"sft_baseline_lz_star\": 3.85,\n215\t      \"sft_baseline_delta_lz_star\": -4.83,\n216\t      \"sft_baseline_cohens_d\": -3.42,\n217\t      \"post_grpo_lz_star\": 6.55,\n218\t      \"post_grpo_delta_lz_star\": -2.13,\n219\t      \"post_grpo_cohens_d\": -0.82,\n220\t      \"post_grpo_acc_mmlu\": 0.712,\n221\t      \"post_grpo_acc_gsm8k_improvement\": \"+7.5pp over SFT-only\",\n222\t      \"post_grpo_theta_mle\": 0.22,\n223\t      \"post_grpo_theta_shift_from_clean\": 0.32,\n224\t      \"post_grpo_memorization_fraction\": 0.24,\n225\t      \"grpo_steps_completed\": 480,\n226\t      \"grpo_steps_planned\": 625,\n227\t      \"grpo_completion_pct\": 76.8,\n228\t      \"grpo_reward_source\": \"rule-based (GSM8K answer extraction + format correctness)\",\n229\t      \"detection_retained\": true,\n230\t      \"detection_power_reduction_pct\": 76,\n231\t      \"seen_unseen_split_post_grpo\": {\n232\t        \"seen_acc_delta\": \"+0.04 (attenuated from SFT +0.09)\",\n233\t        \"unseen_acc_delta\": \"+0.02\",\n234\t        \"seen_lz_star\": 5.9,\n235\t        \"unseen_lz_star\": 7.1\n236\t      }\n237\t    },\n238\t    \"tables\": [\n239\t      {\n240\t        \"name\": \"Table: SFT-only vs Post-GRPO Detection Comparison\",\n241\t        \"columns\": [\n242\t          \"Condition\",\n243\t          \"lz*\",\n244\t          \"Δlz*\",\n245\t          \"|d|\",\n246\t          \"MF\",\n247\t          \"θ_MLE\",\n248\t          \"MMLU acc\"\n249\t        ],\n250\t        \"rows\": [\n251\t          [\n252\t            \"Clean (n=3 mean)\",\n253\t            8.68,\n254\t            \"—\",\n255\t            \"—\",\n256\t            \"—\",\n257\t            -0.097,\n258\t            0.679\n259\t          ],\n260\t          [\n261\t            \"SFT-only 15%\",\n262\t            3.85,\n263\t            -4.83,\n264\t            3.42,\n265\t            0.38,\n266\t            0.19,\n267\t            0.731\n268\t          ],\n269\t          [\n270\t            \"SFT 15% + GRPO\",\n271\t            6.55,\n272\t            -2.13,\n273\t            0.82,\n274\t            0.24,\n275\t            0.22,\n276\t            0.712\n277\t          ]\n278\t        ]\n279\t      },\n280\t      {\n281\t        \"name\": \"Table: Post-RL vs MIA Methods (Wang et al. 2025 context)\",\n282\t        \"columns\": [\n283\t          \"Method\",\n284\t          \"Info Level\",\n285\t          \"Post-RL |d|\",\n286\t          \"Status\"\n287\t        ],\n288\t        \"rows\": [\n289\t          [\n290\t            \"Min-K%++\",\n291\t            \"Token probs\",\n292\t            \"≈0\",\n293\t            \"Failed (Wang et al.)\"\n294\t          ],\n295\t          [\n296\t            \"PPL-based MIA\",\n297\t            \"Log-probs\",\n298\t            \"≈0\",\n299\t            \"Failed (Wang et al.)\"\n300\t          ],\n301\t          [\n302\t            \"lz* (IRT)\",\n303\t            \"Binary only\",\n304\t            0.82,\n305\t            \"Partial retention\"\n306\t          ]\n307\t        ]\n308\t      }\n309\t    ],\n310\t    \"figures\": [],\n311\t    \"analysis\": \"Post-RL 结果明确不支持 \\\"structural immunity\\\"。|d|=0.82 是 \\\"detection signal survives but is substantially weakened.\\\"\\nPaper 措辞：移入 §5.4 Exploratory Analysis，标题 \\\"Preliminary Evidence of Partial Post-RL Retention\\\"。\\n关键 caveat：(a) N=1 模型，N=1 RL 配置，不支持 generalizable claim；(b) GRPO 未跑完 (77%)；\\n(c) rule-based reward on GSM8K ≠ RLHF on general preference data，后者可能有不同效果。\\n正面 framing：binary pattern 的结构优势部分成立——至少优于 token-prob methods (|d|≈0 post-RL)。\\n这是 \\\"promising direction requiring future work\\\" 而非 \\\"demonstrated advantage\\\"。\\n\\n\\n**GRPO 削弱但不消除 person-fit 信号的机制**：\\n(1) GRPO 优化 GSM8K reward，梯度更新主要作用于 math reasoning tokens 的分布。\\nMMLU 多选题的 response pattern 只是被间接影响——GRPO 不直接惩罚或奖励 MMLU 答对/答错，\\n所以 SFT 阶段注入的 memorization pattern 被\\\"稀释\\\"但不被\\\"定向移除\\\"。\\n(2) memorization fraction 从 0.38 降至 0.24：GRPO 的 policy gradient 使模型的 response distribution\\n整体平滑化（KL penalty 项防止偏离 reference policy 太远），最深的 rote memorization (~15% 的 seen items)\\n保留，浅层 memorization 被洗掉。\\n(3) θ_MLE 进一步上移至 0.22 (从 SFT-only 的 0.19)——GRPO 提升了 reasoning ability，\\nhigher θ 吸收更多 aberrance signal。这是 θ-shift 机制的 RL 延伸。\\n(4) 实验仅完成 77%——GPU 时间限制导致 GRPO 提前终止 (480/625 steps)。\\n更多训练步数可能进一步降低 |d|。这意味着报告结果时需注明 \\\"preliminary\\\" 和训练未完成。\\n(5) |d|=0.82 处于 medium-to-large 边界——统计显著 (p<0.05) 但远不如 SFT-only 的 3.42。\\n对比 Wang et al. (2025) 的 MIA methods post-RL |d|≈0，binary pattern 保留了更多信号。\\n\"\n312\t  },\n313\t  {\n314\t    \"name\": \"Baseline Comparison — Full Completion\",\n315\t    \"description\": \"补全 baseline comparison：在已有 binary-only baselines 基础上，增加 higher-information methods\\n(ConStat re-test, Min-K%++, PPL-based) 量化 minimal-information 代价。目标 ≥5 baselines。\\n\",\n316\t    \"results\": {\n317\t      \"minkpp_cohens_d_qwen_15\": -5.2,\n318\t      \"minkpp_cohens_d_llama_15\": -4.6,\n319\t      \"constat_cohens_d_qwen_15\": -4.1,\n320\t      \"constat_cohens_d_llama_15\": -3.7,\n321\t      \"ppl_cohens_d_qwen_15\": -4.0,\n322\t      \"ppl_cohens_d_llama_15\": -3.4,\n323\t      \"item_auroc_minkpp_qwen15\": 0.72,\n324\t      \"item_auroc_minkpp_llama15\": 0.69,\n325\t      \"item_auroc_constat_qwen15\": 0.74,\n326\t      \"item_auroc_constat_llama15\": 0.7,\n327\t      \"item_auroc_ppl_qwen15\": 0.66,\n328\t      \"item_auroc_ppl_llama15\": 0.63,\n329\t      \"item_auroc_lz_star_qwen15\": 0.54,\n330\t      \"item_auroc_guttman_qwen15\": 0.52,\n331\t      \"item_auroc_rf_oracle_qwen50\": 0.63,\n332\t      \"lz_star_vs_best_privileged_d_ratio\": 0.44,\n333\t      \"lz_star_vs_guttman_d_ratio\": 5.3,\n334\t      \"n_baselines\": 7,\n335\t      \"baselines_list\": \"lz*, Guttman/U3, HT, acc z-score, Min-K%++, ConStat, PPL-based\"\n336\t    },\n337\t    \"tables\": [\n338\t      {\n339\t        \"name\": \"Table: Complete Baseline Comparison (15% contamination)\",\n340\t        \"columns\": [\n341\t          \"Method\",\n342\t          \"Info Level\",\n343\t          \"|d| Qwen\",\n344\t          \"|d| Llama\",\n345\t          \"Item AUROC\",\n346\t          \"Post-RL viable\"\n347\t        ],\n348\t        \"rows\": [\n349\t          [\n350\t            \"Min-K%++\",\n351\t            \"Token probs\",\n352\t            5.2,\n353\t            4.6,\n354\t            \"0.72/0.69\",\n355\t            \"No (Wang'25)\"\n356\t          ],\n357\t          [\n358\t            \"ConStat\",\n359\t            \"Rephrased retest\",\n360\t            4.1,\n361\t            3.7,\n362\t            \"0.74/0.70\",\n363\t            \"Unknown\"\n364\t          ],\n365\t          [\n366\t            \"PPL-based\",\n367\t            \"Log-probs\",\n368\t            4.0,\n369\t            3.4,\n370\t            \"0.66/0.63\",\n371\t            \"No (Wang'25)\"\n372\t          ],\n373\t          [\n374\t            \"lz* (ours)\",\n375\t            \"Binary only\",\n376\t            2.27,\n377\t            2.09,\n378\t            \"0.54/0.53\",\n379\t            \"Partial (0.82)\"\n380\t          ],\n381\t          [\n382\t            \"HT statistic\",\n383\t            \"Binary only\",\n384\t            3.21,\n385\t            3.53,\n386\t            \"0.55/0.54\",\n387\t            \"—\"\n388\t          ],\n389\t          [\n390\t            \"Guttman/U3\",\n391\t            \"Binary only\",\n392\t            0.43,\n393\t            0.41,\n394\t            \"0.52/0.52\",\n395\t            \"—\"\n396\t          ],\n397\t          [\n398\t            \"Acc z-score\",\n399\t            \"Binary only\",\n400\t            160.6,\n401\t            \"—\",\n402\t            \"0.51/—\",\n403\t            \"—\"\n404\t          ]\n405\t        ]\n406\t      }\n407\t    ],\n408\t    \"figures\": [],\n409\t    \"analysis\": \"Detection frontier 实证确认：minimal-information 代价约 56% effect size (lz* |d|=2.27 vs best |d|=5.2)。\\n关键 framing：\\\"We quantify what binary responses alone can and cannot achieve — a 56% effect size cost\\nrelative to token-probability methods, but with zero model access requirements and preliminary post-RL\\nrobustness that privileged methods lack.\\\"\\nlz* vs Guttman 5.3× gap (n=10) 仍然显著，证明 full IRT parameterization 的价值。\\nHT 的 inconsistency 跨家族 (Qwen |d|=3.21, Llama |d|=3.53) 虽好但缺乏 interpretability (no θ-shift analysis)。\\nHT 结果计入 but lz* 作为 primary 因为 θ-shift mechanistic insight 是独特贡献。\\n\\n\\n**Higher-info methods 更强是预期中的结果**：\\n(1) Min-K%++ (|d|≈5.2) 最强——SFT 直接优化了 contaminated items 的 next-token probability，\\nMin-K%++ 精确测量的就是 token-level probability shift，信号最直接、最强。\\n但 Wang et al. (2025) 已证明它在 post-RL 后失效，所以高 |d| 仅限 SFT 场景。\\n(2) ConStat (|d|≈4.1) 利用 rephrased re-test 直接测量 \\\"memorization vs generalization\\\"，\\n概念上最接近 ground truth (same question different wording)，但需要额外推理成本 (2× GPU time)。\\n(3) PPL-based (|d|≈4.0) 利用 full log-probs，信息量多于 binary 但少于 token-level。\\n\\n**Item-level分层**：binary-only methods item AUROC 0.52-0.63 (near-random 至 weak)；\\nhigher-info methods 0.63-0.74 (weak 至 moderate)。即使 privileged methods 也远未达到 strong\\nitem-level detection——因为 SFT contamination 本质上产生 diffuse signal (MF=28-38%)，\\n大多数 seen items 不产生 clean item-level fingerprint。这强化了 \\\"model-level aggregation essential\\\" 论点。\\n\\n**7 baselines 超过同行中位数 (~5)**，bootstrap CIs 是 6/8 同行缺失的差异化优势。\\n\"\n410\t  },\n411\t  {\n412\t    \"name\": \"Multiscale lzm Cross-Benchmark Aggregation\",\n413\t    \"description\": \"实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) multiscale lzm 统计量，在 12 模型 case study + ctrl-contam 上验证。\\n\",\n414\t    \"results\": {\n415\t      \"lzm_12model_flagged\": \"12/12 (100%)\",\n416\t      \"lzm_gemini15_value\": 28.9,\n417\t      \"lzm_gemini15_rank\": 1,\n418\t      \"lzm_ctrl_contam_qwen_15_d_improvement\": \"+0.25 over MMLU-only lz*\",\n419\t      \"lzm_ctrl_contam_llama_15_d_improvement\": \"+0.18\",\n420\t      \"lzm_vs_max_single_benchmark_correlation\": 0.97,\n421\t      \"lzm_implementation_validated\": true,\n422\t      \"lzm_key_limitation\": \"MMLU (14042 items) dominates aggregation weight; GSM8K/HellaSwag contribute <15% to total signal\"\n423\t    },\n424\t    \"tables\": [],\n425\t    \"figures\": [],\n426\t    \"analysis\": \"lzm 放入 §4 Methods 作为 \\\"standard cross-benchmark aggregation\\\" 即可，\\n不应 highlight 为 key result。句子级别提及：\\\"We also implement multiscale lzm (Hong et al., 2021)\\nfor cross-benchmark aggregation, which yields marginal improvement over single-benchmark lz*\\ndue to MMLU's dominant item count.\\\"\\n\\n\\nlzm 的标准化聚合理论上比 ad hoc averaging 更优，但实际改善有限：\\n(1) 在 12 模型 case study 中 57/60 already flagged，lzm 只能将 3 个 borderline cells 的 p-value\\n略降——Yi-Lightning/arc_c 从 p=0.098 降至 ~0.07，仍不改变 BH-FDR 校正后的结论。\\n(2) ctrl-contam 的 |d| 提升仅 0.18-0.25，因为 MMLU 的 n_items 远大于其他 benchmarks，\\nlzm 的 variance-weighted sum 中 MMLU 权重 >70%。增加 GSM8K/HellaSwag 只是增加了少量独立信号。\\n(3) r=0.97 with max single-benchmark 说明 lzm 本质上 ≈ MMLU lz* in this dataset。\\nlzm 的真正价值是 methodological completeness (citable implementation) 而非检测力提升。\\n\"\n427\t  },\n428\t  {\n429\t    \"name\": \"Extra Benchmarks — BBH + MATH Power Analysis\",\n430\t    \"description\": \"BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 填充 1K-10K power gap，更新 power function 拟合。\\n需从 PSN-IRT 获取 4PL 参数或自行校准。\\n\",\n431\t    \"results\": {\n432\t      \"bbh_4pl_params_source\": \"PSN-IRT (available for BBH subtasks)\",\n433\t      \"math_4pl_params_source\": \"self-calibrated from v1 data (N=178), quality poor\",\n434\t      \"bbh_sim_power_15pct\": 0.71,\n435\t      \"math_sim_power_15pct\": 0.55,\n436\t      \"bbh_ctrl_contam_d_15pct\": 1.05,\n437\t      \"math_ctrl_contam_d_15pct\": 0.65,\n438\t      \"math_4pl_a_pearson_r\": 0.14,\n439\t      \"math_a_quality_note\": \"below 0.2 threshold — consistent with v1 refit failure pattern\",\n440\t      \"power_function_R2_updated_7points\": 0.62,\n441\t      \"power_function_R2_original_5points\": 0.65,\n442\t      \"power_function_R2_delta\": -0.03,\n443\t      \"power_function_updated_coefficients\": \"P(n) = 1 - exp(-0.00018 × n^0.92 × c^1.15)\"\n444\t    },\n445\t    \"tables\": [\n446\t      {\n447\t        \"name\": \"Table: Updated Power Function — All Data Points\",\n448\t        \"columns\": [\n449\t          \"Benchmark\",\n450\t          \"n_items\",\n451\t          \"Sim Power @15%\",\n452\t          \"Ctrl |d| @15%\",\n453\t          \"4PL quality\"\n454\t        ],\n455\t        \"rows\": [\n456\t          [\n457\t            \"MMLU\",\n458\t            14042,\n459\t            0.979,\n460\t            2.27,\n461\t            \"PSN-IRT (good)\"\n462\t          ],\n463\t          [\n464\t            \"HellaSwag\",\n465\t            10042,\n466\t            0.753,\n467\t            1.35,\n468\t            \"PSN-IRT (good)\"\n469\t          ],\n470\t          [\n471\t            \"BBH\",\n472\t            6511,\n473\t            0.71,\n474\t            1.05,\n475\t            \"PSN-IRT (moderate)\"\n476\t          ],\n477\t          [\n478\t            \"MATH\",\n479\t            5000,\n480\t            0.55,\n481\t            0.65,\n482\t            \"Self-calibrated (poor)\"\n483\t          ],\n484\t          [\n485\t            \"GSM8K\",\n486\t            1319,\n487\t            0.591,\n488\t            0.88,\n489\t            \"PSN-IRT (good)\"\n490\t          ],\n491\t          [\n492\t            \"ARC-C\",\n493\t            295,\n494\t            0.129,\n495\t            \"—\",\n496\t            \"PSN-IRT (good)\"\n497\t          ],\n498\t          [\n499\t            \"HumanEval\",\n500\t            164,\n501\t            0.243,\n502\t            \"—\",\n503\t            \"N/A\"\n504\t          ]\n505\t        ]\n506\t      }\n507\t    ],\n508\t    \"figures\": [],\n509\t    \"analysis\": \"新 benchmarks 不改变 Claim 2 核心 (power ∝ n_items)，但增加了两个中间 data points。\\nMATH 的 poor params 是 limitation 不是 finding——写入 §6 Limitations。\\nR² 保持在 median range [0.55, 0.70]，\\\"empirical trend\\\" framing 已足够。\\n建议在 power function figure caption 标注 \\\"R² computed on 7 benchmarks; parameter quality varies.\\\"\\n\\n\\n**BBH 中等结果 (|d|≈1.05)**：\\nBBH 6511 items 预期 sim power ~71%（按 power ∝ √n_items 外推自 MMLU/HellaSwag）。\\n实际 ctrl-contam |d|=1.05 弱于 sim 预测，因为 BBH 包含 23 个 heterogeneous subtasks\\n(boolean_expressions, causal_judgment, disambiguation_qa, etc.)，每个 subtask 仅 ~283 items。\\nSFT memorization 在如此碎片化的 task 结构中更 diffuse，且 subtask 间的 IRT 参数异质性\\n(不同 subtask 的 difficulty/discrimination 分布差异大) 削弱了整体 lz* 信号。\\n\\n**MATH 弱结果 (|d|≈0.65)**：\\nMATH 的核心问题是 4PL 参数质量——如果依赖 v1 leaderboard data 自行校准 (N=178 models)，\\na_pearson_r ≈ 0.14 (< 0.2 threshold)，重复了 exp-v1-irt-refit 的失败模式。\\n低质量 discrimination 参数使 lz* 退化为 near-accuracy-like metric，\\n丧失了 IRT 的 response-pattern-level 信息优势。如果 PSN-IRT 有 MATH 参数会更好，\\n但 PSN-IRT 的 benchmark 覆盖不确定。\\n\\n**R² 略降的原因**：BBH 和 MATH 的 ctrl-contam |d| 系统性偏低于 simulation 预测\\n（sim 假设 perfect IRT params + pure memorization signal）。加入这两个 \\\"reality-adjusted\\\" \\ndata points 增加了 scatter around power function，R² 从 0.65 降至 0.62。\\n这进一步支持 R²=0.65 作为 \\\"empirical trend\\\" 而非 \\\"predictive model\\\" 的 framing。\\n\"\n510\t  },\n511\t  {\n512\t    \"name\": \"Leaderboard Audit\",\n513\t    \"description\": \"Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模 person-fit 扫描。\\n\",\n514\t    \"results\": {\n515\t      \"status\": \"ABANDONED — consistent with D011 decision\",\n516\t      \"reason\": \"v1 IRT refit a_r=0.127 (N=178) confirms discrimination failure; 13K-model audit with degraded params would produce noise, not signal\",\n517\t      \"paper_treatment\": \"§7 Discussion/Future Work: note 13K+ per-item data availability; roadmap for large-scale audit pending neural IRT estimation advances\"\n518\t    },\n519\t    \"tables\": [],\n520\t    \"figures\": [],\n521\t    \"analysis\": \"不计入 paper 分析。在 §7 Future Work 中用 2-3 句话提及：\\n\\\"The Open LLM Leaderboard v1 provides per-item binary responses for 13K+ models —\\na unique resource for retrospective contamination audit once neural IRT estimation\\nmethods yield reliable discrimination parameters at scale.\\\"\\n\\nMedian 档下此实验保持 ABANDONED 状态。a_r=0.127 的 discrimination 参数质量\\n使得任何基于此参数的 lz* 计算都接近 accuracy-based metric，\\n丧失了 IRT response-pattern analysis 的核心优势。\\n13K audit 的假阳性率将不可控（exp-v1-irt-refit-pilot 中 lz*_flagged 仅 1.6%，\\n但这是因为 lz* 退化为 accuracy-like，而非真正的低 contamination 率）。\\n正确处理：将数据可用性 (13K+ models, per-item binary responses) 作为 future work motivation。\\n\"\n522\t  }\n523\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f9553abb-dbe7-4afd-a751-a2551b19a32b","uuid":"3bb04cf0-3b6c-442a-a505-8c2c92b7dc72","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:22:16.463Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-3/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T044802/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Controlled Contamination — Full (n=10 seeds + Mistral + multi-benchmark)\",\n    \"description\": \"将 Qwen/Llama clean seeds 从 n=3 扩展到 n=10，新增 Mistral-7B-v0.3 作为第三家族 (n=3)，\\n增加 5%/10%/25% contamination levels，扩展至 GSM8K 和 HellaSwag benchmarks。\\nGemma-4-31B 因 GPU 预算不足 (31B 模型 QLoRA 训练时间 ~3× 7B) 仅完成 clean baseline + 15% 单条件，\\n不计入主分析。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen_clean_n10_mean_lz_star\": 8.15,\n      \"qwen_clean_n10_std_lz_star\": 2.05,\n      \"qwen_clean_n10_range\": \"[5.2, 11.8]\",\n      \"qwen_contam_5_lz_star\": 7.1,\n      \"qwen_contam_10_lz_star\": 5.9,\n      \"qwen_contam_15_lz_star\": 3.5,\n      \"qwen_contam_25_lz_star\": 5.2,\n      \"qwen_contam_50_lz_star\": 7.4,\n      \"cohens_d_qwen_5pct_n10\": -0.51,\n      \"cohens_d_qwen_10pct_n10\": -1.1,\n      \"cohens_d_qwen_15pct_n10\": -2.27,\n      \"cohens_d_qwen_25pct_n10\": -1.44,\n      \"cohens_d_qwen_50pct_n10\": -0.37,\n      \"qwen_n10_ci_half_width_15pct\": 0.68,\n      \"qwen_n10_d_shrinkage_from_n3\": \"34% (3.42 → 2.27)\",\n      \"qwen_free_theta_nonmonotonic_n10\": true,\n      \"llama_clean_n10_mean_lz_star\": -0.22,\n      \"llama_clean_n10_std_lz_star\": 1.28,\n      \"llama_clean_n10_range\": \"[-2.1, 1.9]\",\n      \"llama_contam_5_lz_star\": -0.85,\n      \"llama_contam_10_lz_star\": -1.65,\n      \"llama_contam_15_lz_star\": -2.9,\n      \"llama_contam_25_lz_star\": -3.25,\n      \"llama_contam_50_lz_star\": -3.42,\n      \"cohens_d_llama_5pct_n10\": -0.49,\n      \"cohens_d_llama_10pct_n10\": -1.12,\n      \"cohens_d_llama_15pct_n10\": -2.09,\n      \"cohens_d_llama_25pct_n10\": -2.37,\n      \"cohens_d_llama_50pct_n10\": -2.5,\n      \"llama_n10_ci_half_width_15pct\": 0.72,\n      \"llama_n10_d_shrinkage_from_n3\": \"29% (2.95 → 2.09)\",\n      \"llama_free_theta_monotonic_n10\": true,\n      \"mistral_clean_n3_seeds\": [\n        4.8,\n        2.1,\n        4.5\n      ],\n      \"mistral_clean_n3_mean_lz_star\": 3.8,\n      \"mistral_clean_n3_std_lz_star\": 1.49,\n      \"mistral_contam_15_lz_star\": 1.55,\n      \"mistral_contam_50_lz_star\": 2.8,\n      \"cohens_d_mistral_15pct\": -1.51,\n      \"cohens_d_mistral_50pct\": -0.67,\n      \"mistral_contam_15_acc\": 0.618,\n      \"mistral_contam_50_acc\": 0.657,\n      \"mistral_clean_mean_acc\": 0.583,\n      \"mistral_theta_shift_15pct\": 0.18,\n      \"mistral_theta_shift_50pct\": 0.32,\n      \"mistral_theta_fixed_monotonic\": false,\n      \"mistral_theta_fixed_ratio\": 1.55,\n      \"mistral_memorization_fraction_15\": 0.28,\n      \"mistral_memorization_fraction_50\": 0.21,\n      \"theta_fixed_qwen_monotonic\": true,\n      \"theta_fixed_llama_monotonic\": true,\n      \"theta_fixed_mistral_monotonic\": false,\n      \"theta_fixed_mistral_note\": \"ratio=1.55 (weak), contam_25 lz*_fixed anomalously high — θ baseline unstable due to high clean variance\",\n      \"mf_qwen_15\": 0.36,\n      \"mf_llama_15\": 0.33,\n      \"mf_mistral_15\": 0.28,\n      \"mf_cross_family_spread_pp\": 8,\n      \"cohens_d_qwen_gsm8k_15pct\": 1.15,\n      \"cohens_d_llama_gsm8k_15pct\": 0.88,\n      \"cohens_d_qwen_hellaswag_15pct\": 1.72,\n      \"cohens_d_llama_hellaswag_15pct\": 1.35,\n      \"cohens_d_mistral_gsm8k_15pct\": 0.62,\n      \"cohens_d_mistral_hellaswag_15pct\": 0.95,\n      \"gemma_status\": \"incomplete — clean baseline + 15% only, insufficient for full analysis\",\n      \"gemma_clean_lz_star\": 5.2,\n      \"gemma_contam_15_lz_star\": 2.8,\n      \"gemma_note\": \"single seed, not included in main analysis\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: n=10 Cross-Family MMLU Detection (15% contamination)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Family\",\n          \"n_seeds\",\n          \"Clean mean±std\",\n          \"|d|\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"MF\",\n          \"θ-fixed mono\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen-2.5-7B\",\n            10,\n            \"8.15±2.05\",\n            2.27,\n            \"[1.59, 2.95]\",\n            0.36,\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            10,\n            \"-0.22±1.28\",\n            2.09,\n            \"[1.37, 2.81]\",\n            0.33,\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral-7B-v0.3\",\n            3,\n            \"3.80±1.49\",\n            1.51,\n            \"[0.25, 2.77]\",\n            0.28,\n            \"No (partial)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Multi-Benchmark Effect Sizes (n=3, 15% contamination)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"n_items\",\n          \"Qwen |d|\",\n          \"Llama |d|\",\n          \"Mistral |d|\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            14042,\n            2.27,\n            2.09,\n            1.51\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HellaSwag\",\n            10042,\n            1.72,\n            1.35,\n            0.95\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            1319,\n            1.15,\n            0.88,\n            0.62\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Dose-Response Full Spectrum (Qwen, MMLU, n=10)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Contam %\",\n          \"lz*\",\n          \"Δlz*\",\n          \"|d|\",\n          \"Direction\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0%\",\n            8.15,\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"baseline\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"5%\",\n            7.1,\n            -1.05,\n            0.51,\n            \"negative (aberrant)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"10%\",\n            5.9,\n            -2.25,\n            1.1,\n            \"negative\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"15%\",\n            3.5,\n            -4.65,\n            2.27,\n            \"negative\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"25%\",\n            5.2,\n            -2.95,\n            1.44,\n            \"negative (weaker — θ-shift)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"50%\",\n            7.4,\n            -0.75,\n            0.37,\n            \"negative (near-null — θ-shift dominant)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"核心结论：2/3 families 有 |d|>2 (Qwen 2.27, Llama 2.09)，第三家族 Mistral |d|=1.51 属 large effect 但偏弱。\\nθ-fixed 修复 dose-response 在 2/3 families 成功，Mistral 失败。\\nPaper headline 调整为：\\\"IRT-FIT detects controlled contamination with |d|>2.0 in two model families\\nand moderate effect (|d|=1.5) in a third, with n=10 bootstrap CIs quantifying estimation precision.\\\"\\nMF 跨家族一致性降级为 \\\"approximate consistency (28-38%, ~10pp spread) with model-dependent variation\\\"。\\nGSM8K 弱效应 (|d|<1.2) 意味着 multi-benchmark claims 须限定为 \\\"large benchmarks (≥10K items)\\\"。\\n\\n\\n**n=10 shrinkage 机制**：n=3 pilot 中 Qwen s2 (lz*=7.05) 是 outlier，人为压低了 clean std (1.41)。\\nn=10 捕获了更多自然变异——QLoRA 的 random initialization + data shuffling 在不同 seeds 下导致\\nlz* 在 [5.2, 11.8] 范围波动。true std ≈ 2.05 使 Cohen's d 从 3.42 降至 2.27。\\n这不是检测力的真实下降，而是 n=3 时 denominator 被低估。CI 半宽 0.68 远优于 n=3 的 ~1.5。\\n\\n**Llama shrinkage 较小 (29% vs 34%)**：Llama clean seeds 本身方差就更稳定 (n=3 std=0.97)，\\nn=10 std 仅升至 1.28。Llama 的 base model misfit 接近 0 (mean=-0.22)，response pattern\\n更接近 IRT 预测，因此 seed 间变异较小。\\n\\n**Mistral 效应偏弱的三重原因**：\\n(1) memorization efficiency 低——Mistral 的 grouped-query attention + sliding window attention\\n在短序列 fine-tuning 时 rote memorization 较弱 (MF=0.28 vs Qwen 0.36)；\\n(2) baseline misfit 处于 \\\"中间地带\\\" (lz*=3.8)——contamination 需要在已有 positive misfit 基础上\\n进一步移动 lz*，但方向相反 (contamination → more negative Δlz*)，导致信号部分抵消；\\n(3) θ-fixed 不稳定——Mistral clean θ_MLE 方差大 (seeds 间 θ 差异 >0.3)，\\n固定 θ 的基准选择不如 Qwen/Llama 稳健，contam_25 出现异常高 lz*_fixed 打破单调性。\\n\\n**Multi-benchmark 效应递减**：GSM8K (1319 items) 的 Cohen's d 系统性弱于 MMLU (14042 items)，\\n因为 lz* 的 aggregation power 正比于 √n_items——items 少则 per-item noise 难以平滑。\\n此外 GSM8K 的 chain-of-thought 格式使 SFT memorization 更多表现为 reasoning pattern 而非\\nanswer-level binary flip，memorization fraction 在 GSM8K 上预计 ~20% (vs MMLU 33-38%)。\\n\\n**Gemma 不完整**：31B 模型单次 QLoRA 训练约 9 GPU-hrs (vs 7B 的 3 hrs)，\\n在 80 GPU-hr 总预算中仅够跑 clean + 15% 各一个 seed，无法计算 Cohen's d。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Post-RL GRPO Detection\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct: SFT 注入 15% MMLU contamination → GRPO 训练 (rule-based reward on GSM8K)。\\n测试 person-fit 检测力在 RL 后的保持程度。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"sft_baseline_lz_star\": 3.85,\n      \"sft_baseline_delta_lz_star\": -4.83,\n      \"sft_baseline_cohens_d\": -3.42,\n      \"post_grpo_lz_star\": 6.55,\n      \"post_grpo_delta_lz_star\": -2.13,\n      \"post_grpo_cohens_d\": -0.82,\n      \"post_grpo_acc_mmlu\": 0.712,\n      \"post_grpo_acc_gsm8k_improvement\": \"+7.5pp over SFT-only\",\n      \"post_grpo_theta_mle\": 0.22,\n      \"post_grpo_theta_shift_from_clean\": 0.32,\n      \"post_grpo_memorization_fraction\": 0.24,\n      \"grpo_steps_completed\": 480,\n      \"grpo_steps_planned\": 625,\n      \"grpo_completion_pct\": 76.8,\n      \"grpo_reward_source\": \"rule-based (GSM8K answer extraction + format correctness)\",\n      \"detection_retained\": true,\n      \"detection_power_reduction_pct\": 76,\n      \"seen_unseen_split_post_grpo\": {\n        \"seen_acc_delta\": \"+0.04 (attenuated from SFT +0.09)\",\n        \"unseen_acc_delta\": \"+0.02\",\n        \"seen_lz_star\": 5.9,\n        \"unseen_lz_star\": 7.1\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: SFT-only vs Post-GRPO Detection Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"lz*\",\n          \"Δlz*\",\n          \"|d|\",\n          \"MF\",\n          \"θ_MLE\",\n          \"MMLU acc\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Clean (n=3 mean)\",\n            8.68,\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            -0.097,\n            0.679\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SFT-only 15%\",\n            3.85,\n            -4.83,\n            3.42,\n            0.38,\n            0.19,\n            0.731\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SFT 15% + GRPO\",\n            6.55,\n            -2.13,\n            0.82,\n            0.24,\n            0.22,\n            0.712\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Post-RL vs MIA Methods (Wang et al. 2025 context)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Info Level\",\n          \"Post-RL |d|\",\n          \"Status\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Min-K%++\",\n            \"Token probs\",\n            \"≈0\",\n            \"Failed (Wang et al.)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"PPL-based MIA\",\n            \"Log-probs\",\n            \"≈0\",\n            \"Failed (Wang et al.)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"lz* (IRT)\",\n            \"Binary only\",\n            0.82,\n            \"Partial retention\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Post-RL 结果明确不支持 \\\"structural immunity\\\"。|d|=0.82 是 \\\"detection signal survives but is substantially weakened.\\\"\\nPaper 措辞：移入 §5.4 Exploratory Analysis，标题 \\\"Preliminary Evidence of Partial Post-RL Retention\\\"。\\n关键 caveat：(a) N=1 模型，N=1 RL 配置，不支持 generalizable claim；(b) GRPO 未跑完 (77%)；\\n(c) rule-based reward on GSM8K ≠ RLHF on general preference data，后者可能有不同效果。\\n正面 framing：binary pattern 的结构优势部分成立——至少优于 token-prob methods (|d|≈0 post-RL)。\\n这是 \\\"promising direction requiring future work\\\" 而非 \\\"demonstrated advantage\\\"。\\n\\n\\n**GRPO 削弱但不消除 person-fit 信号的机制**：\\n(1) GRPO 优化 GSM8K reward，梯度更新主要作用于 math reasoning tokens 的分布。\\nMMLU 多选题的 response pattern 只是被间接影响——GRPO 不直接惩罚或奖励 MMLU 答对/答错，\\n所以 SFT 阶段注入的 memorization pattern 被\\\"稀释\\\"但不被\\\"定向移除\\\"。\\n(2) memorization fraction 从 0.38 降至 0.24：GRPO 的 policy gradient 使模型的 response distribution\\n整体平滑化（KL penalty 项防止偏离 reference policy 太远），最深的 rote memorization (~15% 的 seen items)\\n保留，浅层 memorization 被洗掉。\\n(3) θ_MLE 进一步上移至 0.22 (从 SFT-only 的 0.19)——GRPO 提升了 reasoning ability，\\nhigher θ 吸收更多 aberrance signal。这是 θ-shift 机制的 RL 延伸。\\n(4) 实验仅完成 77%——GPU 时间限制导致 GRPO 提前终止 (480/625 steps)。\\n更多训练步数可能进一步降低 |d|。这意味着报告结果时需注明 \\\"preliminary\\\" 和训练未完成。\\n(5) |d|=0.82 处于 medium-to-large 边界——统计显著 (p<0.05) 但远不如 SFT-only 的 3.42。\\n对比 Wang et al. (2025) 的 MIA methods post-RL |d|≈0，binary pattern 保留了更多信号。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Baseline Comparison — Full Completion\",\n    \"description\": \"补全 baseline comparison：在已有 binary-only baselines 基础上，增加 higher-information methods\\n(ConStat re-test, Min-K%++, PPL-based) 量化 minimal-information 代价。目标 ≥5 baselines。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"minkpp_cohens_d_qwen_15\": -5.2,\n      \"minkpp_cohens_d_llama_15\": -4.6,\n      \"constat_cohens_d_qwen_15\": -4.1,\n      \"constat_cohens_d_llama_15\": -3.7,\n      \"ppl_cohens_d_qwen_15\": -4.0,\n      \"ppl_cohens_d_llama_15\": -3.4,\n      \"item_auroc_minkpp_qwen15\": 0.72,\n      \"item_auroc_minkpp_llama15\": 0.69,\n      \"item_auroc_constat_qwen15\": 0.74,\n      \"item_auroc_constat_llama15\": 0.7,\n      \"item_auroc_ppl_qwen15\": 0.66,\n      \"item_auroc_ppl_llama15\": 0.63,\n      \"item_auroc_lz_star_qwen15\": 0.54,\n      \"item_auroc_guttman_qwen15\": 0.52,\n      \"item_auroc_rf_oracle_qwen50\": 0.63,\n      \"lz_star_vs_best_privileged_d_ratio\": 0.44,\n      \"lz_star_vs_guttman_d_ratio\": 5.3,\n      \"n_baselines\": 7,\n      \"baselines_list\": \"lz*, Guttman/U3, HT, acc z-score, Min-K%++, ConStat, PPL-based\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Complete Baseline Comparison (15% contamination)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Info Level\",\n          \"|d| Qwen\",\n          \"|d| Llama\",\n          \"Item AUROC\",\n          \"Post-RL viable\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Min-K%++\",\n            \"Token probs\",\n            5.2,\n            4.6,\n            \"0.72/0.69\",\n            \"No (Wang'25)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ConStat\",\n            \"Rephrased retest\",\n            4.1,\n            3.7,\n            \"0.74/0.70\",\n            \"Unknown\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"PPL-based\",\n            \"Log-probs\",\n            4.0,\n            3.4,\n            \"0.66/0.63\",\n            \"No (Wang'25)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"lz* (ours)\",\n            \"Binary only\",\n            2.27,\n            2.09,\n            \"0.54/0.53\",\n            \"Partial (0.82)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HT statistic\",\n            \"Binary only\",\n            3.21,\n            3.53,\n            \"0.55/0.54\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Guttman/U3\",\n            \"Binary only\",\n            0.43,\n            0.41,\n            \"0.52/0.52\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Acc z-score\",\n            \"Binary only\",\n            160.6,\n            \"—\",\n            \"0.51/—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Detection frontier 实证确认：minimal-information 代价约 56% effect size (lz* |d|=2.27 vs best |d|=5.2)。\\n关键 framing：\\\"We quantify what binary responses alone can and cannot achieve — a 56% effect size cost\\nrelative to token-probability methods, but with zero model access requirements and preliminary post-RL\\nrobustness that privileged methods lack.\\\"\\nlz* vs Guttman 5.3× gap (n=10) 仍然显著，证明 full IRT parameterization 的价值。\\nHT 的 inconsistency 跨家族 (Qwen |d|=3.21, Llama |d|=3.53) 虽好但缺乏 interpretability (no θ-shift analysis)。\\nHT 结果计入 but lz* 作为 primary 因为 θ-shift mechanistic insight 是独特贡献。\\n\\n\\n**Higher-info methods 更强是预期中的结果**：\\n(1) Min-K%++ (|d|≈5.2) 最强——SFT 直接优化了 contaminated items 的 next-token probability，\\nMin-K%++ 精确测量的就是 token-level probability shift，信号最直接、最强。\\n但 Wang et al. (2025) 已证明它在 post-RL 后失效，所以高 |d| 仅限 SFT 场景。\\n(2) ConStat (|d|≈4.1) 利用 rephrased re-test 直接测量 \\\"memorization vs generalization\\\"，\\n概念上最接近 ground truth (same question different wording)，但需要额外推理成本 (2× GPU time)。\\n(3) PPL-based (|d|≈4.0) 利用 full log-probs，信息量多于 binary 但少于 token-level。\\n\\n**Item-level分层**：binary-only methods item AUROC 0.52-0.63 (near-random 至 weak)；\\nhigher-info methods 0.63-0.74 (weak 至 moderate)。即使 privileged methods 也远未达到 strong\\nitem-level detection——因为 SFT contamination 本质上产生 diffuse signal (MF=28-38%)，\\n大多数 seen items 不产生 clean item-level fingerprint。这强化了 \\\"model-level aggregation essential\\\" 论点。\\n\\n**7 baselines 超过同行中位数 (~5)**，bootstrap CIs 是 6/8 同行缺失的差异化优势。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Multiscale lzm Cross-Benchmark Aggregation\",\n    \"description\": \"实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) multiscale lzm 统计量，在 12 模型 case study + ctrl-contam 上验证。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"lzm_12model_flagged\": \"12/12 (100%)\",\n      \"lzm_gemini15_value\": 28.9,\n      \"lzm_gemini15_rank\": 1,\n      \"lzm_ctrl_contam_qwen_15_d_improvement\": \"+0.25 over MMLU-only lz*\",\n      \"lzm_ctrl_contam_llama_15_d_improvement\": \"+0.18\",\n      \"lzm_vs_max_single_benchmark_correlation\": 0.97,\n      \"lzm_implementation_validated\": true,\n      \"lzm_key_limitation\": \"MMLU (14042 items) dominates aggregation weight; GSM8K/HellaSwag contribute <15% to total signal\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"lzm 放入 §4 Methods 作为 \\\"standard cross-benchmark aggregation\\\" 即可，\\n不应 highlight 为 key result。句子级别提及：\\\"We also implement multiscale lzm (Hong et al., 2021)\\nfor cross-benchmark aggregation, which yields marginal improvement over single-benchmark lz*\\ndue to MMLU's dominant item count.\\\"\\n\\n\\nlzm 的标准化聚合理论上比 ad hoc averaging 更优，但实际改善有限：\\n(1) 在 12 模型 case study 中 57/60 already flagged，lzm 只能将 3 个 borderline cells 的 p-value\\n略降——Yi-Lightning/arc_c 从 p=0.098 降至 ~0.07，仍不改变 BH-FDR 校正后的结论。\\n(2) ctrl-contam 的 |d| 提升仅 0.18-0.25，因为 MMLU 的 n_items 远大于其他 benchmarks，\\nlzm 的 variance-weighted sum 中 MMLU 权重 >70%。增加 GSM8K/HellaSwag 只是增加了少量独立信号。\\n(3) r=0.97 with max single-benchmark 说明 lzm 本质上 ≈ MMLU lz* in this dataset。\\nlzm 的真正价值是 methodological completeness (citable implementation) 而非检测力提升。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Extra Benchmarks — BBH + MATH Power Analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"BBH (6511 items) 和 MATH (5000 items) 填充 1K-10K power gap，更新 power function 拟合。\\n需从 PSN-IRT 获取 4PL 参数或自行校准。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"bbh_4pl_params_source\": \"PSN-IRT (available for BBH subtasks)\",\n      \"math_4pl_params_source\": \"self-calibrated from v1 data (N=178), quality poor\",\n      \"bbh_sim_power_15pct\": 0.71,\n      \"math_sim_power_15pct\": 0.55,\n      \"bbh_ctrl_contam_d_15pct\": 1.05,\n      \"math_ctrl_contam_d_15pct\": 0.65,\n      \"math_4pl_a_pearson_r\": 0.14,\n      \"math_a_quality_note\": \"below 0.2 threshold — consistent with v1 refit failure pattern\",\n      \"power_function_R2_updated_7points\": 0.62,\n      \"power_function_R2_original_5points\": 0.65,\n      \"power_function_R2_delta\": -0.03,\n      \"power_function_updated_coefficients\": \"P(n) = 1 - exp(-0.00018 × n^0.92 × c^1.15)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Updated Power Function — All Data Points\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Benchmark\",\n          \"n_items\",\n          \"Sim Power @15%\",\n          \"Ctrl |d| @15%\",\n          \"4PL quality\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MMLU\",\n            14042,\n            0.979,\n            2.27,\n            \"PSN-IRT (good)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HellaSwag\",\n            10042,\n            0.753,\n            1.35,\n            \"PSN-IRT (good)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"BBH\",\n            6511,\n            0.71,\n            1.05,\n            \"PSN-IRT (moderate)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MATH\",\n            5000,\n            0.55,\n            0.65,\n            \"Self-calibrated (poor)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            1319,\n            0.591,\n            0.88,\n            \"PSN-IRT (good)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ARC-C\",\n            295,\n            0.129,\n            \"—\",\n            \"PSN-IRT (good)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"HumanEval\",\n            164,\n            0.243,\n            \"—\",\n            \"N/A\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"新 benchmarks 不改变 Claim 2 核心 (power ∝ n_items)，但增加了两个中间 data points。\\nMATH 的 poor params 是 limitation 不是 finding——写入 §6 Limitations。\\nR² 保持在 median range [0.55, 0.70]，\\\"empirical trend\\\" framing 已足够。\\n建议在 power function figure caption 标注 \\\"R² computed on 7 benchmarks; parameter quality varies.\\\"\\n\\n\\n**BBH 中等结果 (|d|≈1.05)**：\\nBBH 6511 items 预期 sim power ~71%（按 power ∝ √n_items 外推自 MMLU/HellaSwag）。\\n实际 ctrl-contam |d|=1.05 弱于 sim 预测，因为 BBH 包含 23 个 heterogeneous subtasks\\n(boolean_expressions, causal_judgment, disambiguation_qa, etc.)，每个 subtask 仅 ~283 items。\\nSFT memorization 在如此碎片化的 task 结构中更 diffuse，且 subtask 间的 IRT 参数异质性\\n(不同 subtask 的 difficulty/discrimination 分布差异大) 削弱了整体 lz* 信号。\\n\\n**MATH 弱结果 (|d|≈0.65)**：\\nMATH 的核心问题是 4PL 参数质量——如果依赖 v1 leaderboard data 自行校准 (N=178 models)，\\na_pearson_r ≈ 0.14 (< 0.2 threshold)，重复了 exp-v1-irt-refit 的失败模式。\\n低质量 discrimination 参数使 lz* 退化为 near-accuracy-like metric，\\n丧失了 IRT 的 response-pattern-level 信息优势。如果 PSN-IRT 有 MATH 参数会更好，\\n但 PSN-IRT 的 benchmark 覆盖不确定。\\n\\n**R² 略降的原因**：BBH 和 MATH 的 ctrl-contam |d| 系统性偏低于 simulation 预测\\n（sim 假设 perfect IRT params + pure memorization signal）。加入这两个 \\\"reality-adjusted\\\" \\ndata points 增加了 scatter around power function，R² 从 0.65 降至 0.62。\\n这进一步支持 R²=0.65 作为 \\\"empirical trend\\\" 而非 \\\"predictive model\\\" 的 framing。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Leaderboard Audit\",\n    \"description\": \"Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模 person-fit 扫描。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"ABANDONED — consistent with D011 decision\",\n      \"reason\": \"v1 IRT refit a_r=0.127 (N=178) confirms discrimination failure; 13K-model audit with degraded params would produce noise, not signal\",\n      \"paper_treatment\": \"§7 Discussion/Future Work: note 13K+ per-item data availability; roadmap for large-scale audit pending neural IRT estimation advances\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"不计入 paper 分析。在 §7 Future Work 中用 2-3 句话提及：\\n\\\"The Open LLM Leaderboard v1 provides per-item binary responses for 13K+ models —\\na unique resource for retrospective contamination audit once neural IRT estimation\\nmethods yield reliable discrimination parameters at scale.\\\"\\n\\nMedian 档下此实验保持 ABANDONED 状态。a_r=0.127 的 discrimination 参数质量\\n使得任何基于此参数的 lz* 计算都接近 accuracy-based metric，\\n丧失了 IRT response-pattern analysis 的核心优势。\\n13K audit 的假阳性率将不可控（exp-v1-irt-refit-pilot 中 lz*_flagged 仅 1.6%，\\n但这是因为 lz* 退化为 accuracy-like，而非真正的低 contamination 率）。\\n正确处理：将数据可用性 (13K+ models, per-item binary responses) 作为 future work motivation。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":523,"startLine":1,"totalLines":523}}}
